Error [jet.MoveWithoutMarker]: Implicit move of `h.res`
  --> tests/ui/resource_move_needs_mark.jet:26:15
    |
 26 |     out = Val(h.res)
    |               ^^^^^
 Why: `h.res` holds a resource, which has one cleanup owner; this owning position takes it out of `h`, and a value with cleanup moves only where `^` writes the move
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^h.res`), or use the value where it is
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209

Error [jet.MoveWithoutMarker]: Implicit move of `found`
  --> tests/ui/resource_move_needs_mark.jet:34:34
    |
 34 |         .Val(found) -> out = Val(found)
    |                                  ^^^^^
 Why: `found` holds a resource, which has one cleanup owner; this owning position takes it out of its matched subject, and a value with cleanup moves only where `^` writes the move
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^found`), or use the value where it is
